{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIxL0luJTIwVGhlJTIwRWFydGglMjAlMjgyMDIxJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"In The Earth","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/a2e9GLb14xX1DFv80nsioci5Zld.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fjRlDPqo2qqMBoUItMtTDZe9kvZ.jpg","description":"As a deadly virus ravages the world, Dr. Martin Lowery embarks on a mission to reach test site ATU327A, a research hub deep in the Arboreal Forest. The arduous journey, guided by park scout Alma, is set back by a nighttime attack that leaves the two bruised and shoeless. When they run into Zach, a man living off the grid, they gratefully accept his help. Zach’s intentions aren’t exactly what they seem, however, and a path out of the forest and into safety quickly fades as the line between myth and science blurs.","releaseInfo":"2021","genres":["Horror","Science Fiction","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.6","runtime":"107 min","cast":["Joel Fry","Ellora Torchia","Hayley Squires","Reece Shearsmith","John Hollingworth","Mark Monero"],"director":["Ben Wheatley"],"released":"2021-04-16T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Nature is a force of evil.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Joel Fry","character":"Dr. Martin Lowery","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tk6RncU1WEvjpeU1hog9cFsjMRC.jpg"},{"name":"Ellora Torchia","character":"Alma","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xGeOoLNne2U3rViaL8adlT7Hhpl.jpg"},{"name":"Hayley Squires","character":"Dr. Olivia Wendle","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nBchYkC2f1boBqJlYny5OVsxgFQ.jpg"},{"name":"Reece Shearsmith","character":"Zach Whitehead","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4RJLh3e4Ha4K2ET8ruPcoaL2gqt.jpg"},{"name":"John Hollingworth","character":"Lord James Karel","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7aT6wgl1xYfBHtW2q3oADUuAwMM.jpg"},{"name":"Mark Monero","character":"Dr. Frank Jarrek","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pfCEeqdFyfMm2Mo2Qkn7aBhzzUP.jpg"}]},"trailers":[{"source":"3Lqkfo7